WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.544 --> 00:00:14.326
Summer was almost over.

2
00:00:15.386 --> 00:00:18.889
Soon, Vinnie and Mandy would be starting school.

3
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:22.512
Right now, they were folding laundry.

4
00:00:22.532 --> 00:00:27.756
"Dad has almost finished moving into the attic," said Vinnie.

5
00:00:27.776 --> 00:00:32.000
"We don't have a lot of time left for photo trips!"

6
00:00:33.436 --> 00:00:39.319
"And when school starts, we won't have any time at all," Mandy sighed.

7
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.341
The children looked at each other.

8
00:00:42.361 --> 00:00:46.423
"We shouldn't waste a single moment," said Vinnie.

9
00:00:47.364 --> 00:00:50.146
He tossed a sock into the laundry basket.

10
00:00:50.166 --> 00:00:55.549
"Mom and Dad are in the kitchen," Mandy said in a low voice.

11
00:00:56.849 --> 00:00:59.131
"Maybe we can sneak upstairs."

12
00:00:59.151 --> 00:01:04.270
"Let's go," said Vinnie, and they ran up the steps.

13
00:01:05.751 --> 00:01:10.315
Once they were inside the attic, Mandy grabbed the photo album.

14
00:01:10.335 --> 00:01:12.177
"Look, Vinnie!"

15
00:01:12.817 --> 00:01:13.918
exclaimed Mandy.

16
00:01:13.938 --> 00:01:17.241
"We're almost at the end of the album."

17
00:01:18.522 --> 00:01:21.164
She showed him how many pages were left.

18
00:01:21.184 --> 00:01:26.088
"I can't believe how many trips we've done," said Vinnie.

19
00:01:26.108 --> 00:01:32.073
"This is interesting," said Mandy, pointing to the new photo.

20
00:01:33.373 --> 00:01:36.154
The old man stood in a boat by a river.

21
00:01:37.335 --> 00:01:39.156
The sun was setting behind him.

22
00:01:40.276 --> 00:01:42.957
Something glowing leaped out of the water.

23
00:01:42.977 --> 00:01:45.778
"Can you tell where this is?"

24
00:01:46.379 --> 00:01:47.079
asked Mandy.

25
00:01:47.679 --> 00:01:48.840
Vinnie shook his head.

26
00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:52.201
"Well, we're about to find out!"

27
00:01:52.821 --> 00:01:53.682
Mandy cried.

28
00:01:54.842 --> 00:01:58.704
The picture glowed brighter, and the children's eyes closed.

29
00:02:00.216 --> 00:02:02.978
Soon they were spinning down the dark tunnel.

30
00:02:05.179 --> 00:02:08.321
Mandy and Vinnie fell onto soft soil.

31
00:02:09.401 --> 00:02:11.202
They could hear shouts and laughter.

32
00:02:11.222 --> 00:02:14.784
"Where are we?"

33
00:02:15.445 --> 00:02:17.106
asked Mandy, standing up.

34
00:02:18.186 --> 00:02:19.967
They were in a small village.

35
00:02:21.008 --> 00:02:23.169
People were running around laughing.

36
00:02:24.109 --> 00:02:28.392
Two women hurried over to the children, holding small cups.

37
00:02:29.416 --> 00:02:31.737
They splashed Vinnie with colored water.

38
00:02:31.757 --> 00:02:35.179
"Gross! What is this?"

39
00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:36.840
screamed Vinnie.

40
00:02:37.861 --> 00:02:40.382
The front of his shirt was soaked bright red.

41
00:02:41.463 --> 00:02:43.144
He rubbed at the wet stain.

42
00:02:43.164 --> 00:02:48.927
"Everyone is splashing each other," Mandy said, looking around.

43
00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:53.109
The street was filled with people holding cups.

44
00:02:54.229 --> 00:02:58.732
Laughing loudly, they chased each other, throwing colored water.

45
00:03:00.136 --> 00:03:01.277
"What's going on?"

46
00:03:01.918 --> 00:03:02.558
asked Vinnie.

47
00:03:03.699 --> 00:03:05.341
A boy splashed Mandy.

48
00:03:05.361 --> 00:03:08.824
"Hey!" cried Mandy.

49
00:03:09.864 --> 00:03:12.927
Her sleeve and part of her arm were stained purple.

50
00:03:14.188 --> 00:03:18.812
The boy set down his cup and put his hands together in front of his chest.

51
00:03:18.832 --> 00:03:22.855
"Hello," he said, bowing slightly.

52
00:03:23.896 --> 00:03:27.980
His face, arms, and clothes were soaked in many bright colors.

53
00:03:29.296 --> 00:03:31.697
The children imitated the boy's greeting.

54
00:03:32.877 --> 00:03:35.298
Vinnie introduced himself and Mandy.

55
00:03:35.318 --> 00:03:38.859
"I'm Rishi," said the boy.

56
00:03:38.879 --> 00:03:41.640
"Is this your first time here?"

57
00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.680
Vinnie and Mandy nodded.

58
00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.161
"What's going on?"

59
00:03:46.781 --> 00:03:47.421
asked Vinnie.

60
00:03:47.441 --> 00:03:50.122
"It's the spring festival!"

61
00:03:50.642 --> 00:03:53.063
shouted Rishi, picking up his cup.

62
00:03:54.203 --> 00:03:56.144
He splashed someone running by.

63
00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:00.002
Everyone was soaked with different colors.

64
00:04:01.363 --> 00:04:03.964
Mandy noticed a cup someone had dropped.

65
00:04:05.125 --> 00:04:05.946
She picked it up.

66
00:04:07.287 --> 00:04:09.668
There was still some colored water inside.

67
00:04:09.688 --> 00:04:16.273
"Oh well, if you can't beat them, join them," she said.

68
00:04:17.333 --> 00:04:21.096
Mandy laughed and quickly splashed Rishi and her brother.
